<title>CHINA: Shanghai opens public info computer network.</title>
<headline>Shanghai opens public info computer network.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai city has set up a free public information computer network, called Shanghai Online, comprising more than a dozen databanks of information, Xinhua news agency reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The agency said all residents who owned computers would be able to access the system, which it said had links to other domestic and international networks. It gave no other details.</p>
</text>
